{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019SuvxKWLPDTpnd8A7Ee7VF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我来分析每个 planned 实验在 worst 档位下的预测数据。\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  \"LLM degrades\" framing 不成立。Per-layer RSA 呈 U-shape 而非单调下降，LLM 深层恢复到接近 projector level，\n  说明 LLM 既不增强也不最终损害 action structure。Reframe 为 \"Representational Redundancy\"：\n  LLM 的 32 层变换是 lossy-then-recovery 过程，对 action structure 而言是 redundant bottleneck。\n  Random instruction control 出现 Δ>0.03，instruction invariance claim 需 weaken。\n  CKA 与 RSA ordering 不一致，需正面讨论 metric dependency。\n  补做 CLIP-ViT baseline 成为 blocking requirement 以分离 pretraining confound。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output (layer 0) 到 LLM 各层 (layer 1-32) 的变化轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      per_layer_rsa_layer0: 0.59\n      per_layer_rsa_layer4: 0.52\n      per_layer_rsa_layer8: 0.44\n      per_layer_rsa_layer12: 0.39\n      per_layer_rsa_layer16: 0.38\n      per_layer_rsa_layer20: 0.41\n      per_layer_rsa_layer24: 0.45\n      per_layer_rsa_layer28: 0.48\n      per_layer_rsa_layer32: 0.55\n      monotonicity_spearman: -0.18\n      trough_layer: 16\n      trough_rsa: 0.38\n      recovery_ratio: 0.85  # (L32 - trough) / (L0 - trough)\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心信号：RSA 不是单调下降而是 U-shape。Layer 0 (projector output) RSA ≈ 0.59\n      （略低于 d027 的 0.6153 因为 per-layer 提取方式略有不同），中间层（L12-L16）降至 trough ≈ 0.38\n      （接近 DINO 水平），但深层（L28-L32）恢复到 0.55 附近。Spearman 单调性 ≈ -0.18，远弱于\n      monotonic degradation 预期的 < -0.7。这个 U-shape 直接否定 \"LLM degrades\" 的线性叙事：\n      LLM 前半段确实破坏 action structure（为 next-token prediction 重组表征），但后半段\n      通过 residual connections 和 layer normalization 逐步恢复几何结构。最终 L32 的 0.55\n      虽低于 projector 的 0.59，但差距远小于 peak degradation 暗示的程度。这说明 LLM 是\n      lossy-then-recovery 过程，不是单向 degradation。核心 story 必须从 \"degrades\" 转为\n      \"redundant bottleneck\"——LLM 花了 32 层做了一个近似恢复原始结构的变换。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-layer RSA curve (trained, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"RSA ρ\", \"Δ from L0\", \"Phase\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (proj)\", 0.59, \"—\", \"projector output\"]\n          - [\"1\", 0.57, -0.02, \"early\"]\n          - [\"2\", 0.55, -0.04, \"early\"]\n          - [\"4\", 0.52, -0.07, \"early\"]\n          - [\"8\", 0.44, -0.15, \"mid-descent\"]\n          - [\"12\", 0.39, -0.20, \"trough approach\"]\n          - [\"16\", 0.38, -0.21, \"trough\"]\n          - [\"20\", 0.41, -0.18, \"early recovery\"]\n          - [\"24\", 0.45, -0.14, \"recovery\"]\n          - [\"28\", 0.48, -0.11, \"recovery\"]\n          - [\"30\", 0.52, -0.07, \"late recovery\"]\n          - [\"32\", 0.55, -0.04, \"output\"]\n      - name: \"U-shape statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman (layer index vs RSA)\", -0.18]\n          - [\"Trough layer\", 16]\n          - [\"Trough RSA\", 0.38]\n          - [\"L0 RSA\", 0.59]\n          - [\"L32 RSA\", 0.55]\n          - [\"Recovery ratio\", \"85%\"]\n          - [\"Monotonic degradation?\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Line plot: x-axis = layer index (0-32), y-axis = RSA ρ with action structure.\n        曲线呈明显 U-shape：从 L0≈0.59 下降到 L16≈0.38，再回升到 L32≈0.55。\n        水平虚线标注 DINO baseline (0.388) 和 SigLIP+projector (0.615)。\n        Shaded band 为 per-task bootstrap 95% CI。U-shape 在 trained 和 untrained\n        两条曲线上均可见，但 untrained 的 trough 更深（~0.35）且 recovery 更不稳定。\n    analysis: >\n      U-shape 是 worst 档的定义性信号。它否定了 \"monotonic degradation\" narrative，\n      但并不否定 vision encoder dominance（L0 仍是全局 peak）。Reframe 路径：\n      LLM 的 32 层变换是 representational detour——先破坏后恢复，净效果接近 identity。\n      这比 \"degrades\" 更 nuanced，但 \"redundant bottleneck\" 对 CoRL 仍有强 practical\n      message：如果 32 层 LLM 只是把表征转一圈回来，那架构可以大幅简化。\n      需要额外验证：(1) U-shape 在 untrained 条件下是否也成立；(2) recovery 是否\n      来自 residual connections（ablation: 去掉 residual 是否消除 recovery）。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"用随机/无意义 instruction 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 是否影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      random_inst_peak_rsa_trained: 0.445\n      random_inst_peak_rsa_untrained: 0.440\n      random_inst_peak_layer_trained: 12\n      real_inst_peak_rsa_trained: 0.4876\n      delta_random_vs_real_trained: 0.0426\n      delta_random_vs_real_untrained: 0.0446\n      delta_random_vs_no_inst_trained: -0.044\n      no_inst_peak_rsa: 0.4802\n      random_inst_direction: \"random < no_inst ≈ real_inst\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档预测 random instruction 的 RSA 显著低于 real instruction（Δ ≈ 0.04，超过\n      0.03 threshold），且方向出人意料：random instruction 不仅不等于 real instruction，\n      反而比 no instruction 还差。这说明 instruction invariance claim 过于简化——instruction\n      content 确实对 RSA 有影响，但方向是 \"garbage in → degradation\" 而非 \"meaningful\n      instruction → enhancement\"。真实 instruction 和空 instruction 效果相近（Δ=0.004），\n      但 random tokens 积极干扰 LLM 的表征处理，导致 action structure 额外损失。\n      这个结果动摇 Claim 3 的 \"instruction invariance\" 表述：instruction 的 presence\n      不 matter，但 instruction 的 content quality 在极端情况下 does matter。\n      机制解释：random tokens 激活 LLM 的 language processing pathways 产生 out-of-distribution\n      activations，这些 activations 与 vision tokens 在 attention 中竞争，导致 action-relevant\n      信号被稀释。No instruction 下 LLM 只处理 vision tokens，没有这种干扰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Instruction condition comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs Real Inst\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Real instruction (trained)\", 0.4876, 9, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Real instruction (untrained)\", 0.4846, 12, \"—\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (trained)\", 0.489, 30, \"+0.0014\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (untrained)\", 0.4802, 12, \"-0.0044\"]\n          - [\"Random instruction (trained)\", 0.445, 12, \"-0.0426\"]\n          - [\"Random instruction (untrained)\", 0.440, 10, \"-0.0446\"]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, \"—\", \"-0.0996\"]\n      - name: \"Instruction effect decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ RSA\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Real vs No instruction\", 0.004, \"No (< 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"Real vs Random instruction\", 0.043, \"Yes (> 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"No vs Random instruction\", 0.040, \"Yes (> 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"Random vs DINO\", 0.057, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 6 条件的 peak RSA 对比（SigLIP+proj, real_inst, no_inst, random_inst,\n        DINO）。Error bars 为 bootstrap 95% CI。关键视觉信号：random_inst bar 明显低于\n        real_inst 和 no_inst，三者的 CI 不重叠。Annotation 标注 Δ=0.043 between\n        real and random instruction。\n      - >\n        Per-layer RSA curves for 3 instruction conditions (real, no, random) overlaid.\n        Random instruction curve 整体低于另外两条，且 peak 位置偏早（layer 12 vs 30），\n        暗示 random tokens 在深层持续干扰 recovery process。\n    analysis: >\n      Random instruction Δ > 0.03 使 \"instruction invariance\" 的绝对表述不成立。\n      需要 reframe Claim 3：从 \"instruction has no effect\" 改为 \"meaningful instruction\n      content is not utilized for action structure, but adversarial/random instruction\n      can actively degrade it\"。这实际上强化了 redundancy narrative：LLM 不利用\n      instruction 的语义信息来构建 action structure，但如果被喂入 noise，它的 language\n      processing machinery 会主动干扰 vision-derived signals。Practical implication：\n      VLA 部署时应确保 instruction 质量，或者直接去掉 LLM 以消除这个风险面。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保结论不是 RSA 指标特异性产物\"\n    expected_results:\n      cka_siglip_proj_vs_action: 0.52\n      cka_vla_trained_vs_action: 0.50\n      cka_vla_untrained_vs_action: 0.49\n      cka_dino_vs_action: 0.35\n      cka_ordering: \"SigLIP+proj ≈ VLA_trained ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO\"\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP+proj >> VLA_trained ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO\"\n      ordering_consistent: false\n      cka_siglip_vs_vla_delta: 0.02\n      rsa_siglip_vs_vla_delta: 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档预测 CKA 和 RSA 给出不同的 ordering。CKA 下 SigLIP+proj (0.52) 与 VLA (0.50)\n      的差距大幅缩小到 Δ=0.02（RSA 下是 0.127），使得 \"LLM degrades\" 或 \"LLM is redundant\"\n      的 claim 在 CKA 下几乎不成立——两者统计不可区分。原因：CKA 衡量的是 kernel alignment\n      （关注整体 representational similarity structure），对高阶几何变换更 robust；RSA 衡量的\n      是 pairwise distance 的 rank correlation，对 local distortions 更敏感。LLM 的变换\n      主要是 local geometric distortion（为 next-token prediction 旋转/缩放 representation），\n      这在 RSA 下表现为 degradation 但在 CKA 下被 absorbed。这意味着 \"LLM degrades action\n      alignment\" 是 metric-dependent conclusion，reviewer 可以攻击指标选择。同时 CKA\n      仍保持 DINO 显著低于其他条件（0.35 vs 0.49-0.52），所以 vision encoder dominance\n      claim 在两个指标下一致，只是 degradation claim 不 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSA vs CKA ordering comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"RSA ρ\", \"RSA Rank\", \"CKA\", \"CKA Rank\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+projector\", 0.615, 1, 0.52, 1]\n          - [\"VLA trained+inst\", 0.488, 2, 0.50, 2]\n          - [\"VLA untrained+inst\", 0.485, 3, 0.49, 3]\n          - [\"VLA trained no-inst\", 0.489, 2, 0.50, 2]\n          - [\"VLA untrained no-inst\", 0.480, 4, 0.48, 4]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 5, 0.35, 5]\n      - name: \"Metric agreement analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Claim\", \"RSA supports?\", \"CKA supports?\", \"Agreement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision encoder dominance (SigLIP >> DINO)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.227)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.17)\", \"Consistent\"]\n          - [\"LLM degradation (SigLIP >> VLA)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.127)\", \"Marginal (Δ=0.02)\", \"Inconsistent\"]\n          - [\"Training invariance (trained ≈ untrained)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.01)\", \"Consistent\"]\n          - [\"Instruction invariance (inst ≈ no-inst)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.004)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\", \"Consistent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Dual-panel figure: Left panel = RSA-based ordering (bar chart), Right panel = CKA-based\n        ordering (bar chart). Same conditions, same colors. 视觉对比清晰显示 RSA 下 SigLIP+proj\n        显著高于 VLA，但 CKA 下两者接近。红色 annotation 标注 inconsistency region。\n      - >\n        Scatter plot: x-axis = RSA ρ, y-axis = CKA, each point = one condition.\n        Points cluster along a roughly linear trend but SigLIP+proj is an outlier——\n        RSA 偏高但 CKA 不相应偏高，暗示 RSA 对该条件的 sensitivity 更高。\n    analysis: >\n      CKA-RSA ordering inconsistency 是 worst 档的第二个关键信号。它不摧毁整个 story\n      （DINO < VLA < SigLIP 的大序仍成立），但削弱了 degradation 的量化 claim。\n      应对策略：(1) 正面讨论 metric dependency，将其作为 contribution 之一（\"which\n      representational similarity metric is appropriate for evaluating action alignment\n      is itself an open question\"）；(2) 论证 RSA 的 rank-correlation nature 更适合\n      评估 action structure alignment（因为 action space 的 metric structure 是 ordinal），\n      但承认 CKA 给出 weaker version of the claim；(3) 将 degradation claim 从\n      \"LLM degrades\" 改为 \"LLM at best preserves, does not enhance\" action structure——\n      这在两个指标下都成立。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证核心发现\"\n    expected_results:\n      spatial_siglip_proj_rsa: 0.58\n      spatial_vla_trained_rsa: 0.47\n      spatial_vla_untrained_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_dino_rsa: 0.36\n      spatial_per_layer_monotonicity: -0.15\n      spatial_u_shape: true\n      cross_benchmark_ordering_consistent: true\n      spatial_instruction_delta: 0.005\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 的 task structure 与 LIBERO-Goal/Long 不同（强调空间关系而非\n      temporal sequence），预期整体 RSA 略低（空间关系在 action space 中更分散）。\n      但核心 ordering（SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO）应保持一致，验证\n      findings 不是单个 benchmark 的 artifact。U-shape 同样出现但 recovery 程度可能\n      更弱（空间任务的 action structure 更复杂，LLM recovery 更困难）。\n      Instruction invariance 同样成立（Δ ≈ 0.005），因为 LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction\n      同样是简单描述性语句，不提供超出视觉信息的 action guidance。\n      此实验在 worst 档下优先级低于 CLIP baseline，但如果有时间做可以增加 robustness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"LIBERO-Goal RSA\", \"LIBERO-Long RSA\", \"LIBERO-Spatial RSA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+projector\", 0.615, \"—\", 0.58]\n          - [\"VLA trained\", 0.488, 0.488, 0.47]\n          - [\"VLA untrained\", 0.485, 0.485, 0.46]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.388, 0.36]\n      - name: \"Ordering consistency\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Ordering\", \"U-shape?\", \"Instruction Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.004]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Long\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.004]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        3-panel figure, one per benchmark.每 panel 是 per-layer RSA curve for trained/untrained\n        conditions。视觉一致性：所有 3 个 benchmark 都显示相同的 U-shape pattern 和\n        SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO ordering。Spatial benchmark 的绝对值略低但 pattern 一致。\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 预期复现核心 ordering，增强 generalization claim。但在 worst 档下，\n      此实验优先级低于 plan_003 (per-layer curve) 和 CLIP baseline（未在 plan 中但\n      worst 档下成为 blocking）。如果时间有限应优先完成 CLIP baseline。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT baseline (blocking under worst tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — not in original plan, becomes blocking under worst\"\n    description: >\n      补做 CLIP-ViT-L/14（与 SigLIP 同为 vision-language contrastive pretrained）baseline，\n      分离 SigLIP RSA 优势中 vision-language pretraining 的贡献 vs pure vision quality\n    expected_results:\n      clip_rsa: 0.56\n      clip_vs_siglip_delta: 0.055\n      clip_vs_dino_delta: 0.172\n      clip_vs_vla_delta: 0.072\n      pretraining_confound_fraction: 0.76  # (CLIP - DINO) / (SigLIP - DINO)\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下第四个 reviewer 攻击成为 blocking：SigLIP 的 RSA=0.615 优势是否完全来自\n      vision-language pretraining？CLIP-ViT 是同族模型（contrastive image-text pretraining），\n      预期 RSA ≈ 0.56，显著高于 DINO (0.388) 但略低于 SigLIP (0.615)。\n      这意味着 SigLIP-DINO gap 的 ~76% 可归因于 vision-language pretraining 本身，\n      而非 SigLIP 特有的架构/数据优势。这个结果迫使 story 调整：不能说 \"SigLIP vision\n      encoder 提供 action structure\"，而应说 \"vision-language pretrained encoders 天然\n      携带 action-relevant structure，且这种 pretraining bonus 比 VLA fine-tuning 更重要\"。\n      这实际上是一个 stronger insight（pretraining paradigm > fine-tuning），但需要\n      重写 Introduction 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Vision encoder comparison with pretraining control\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"Pretraining\", \"RSA ρ\", \"Δ vs DINO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP-SO400M\", \"image-text contrastive (WebLI)\", 0.615, \"+0.227\"]\n          - [\"CLIP-ViT-L/14\", \"image-text contrastive (LAION)\", 0.56, \"+0.172\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2-L\", \"self-supervised (LVD-142M)\", 0.388, \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Confound decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Component\", \"RSA contribution\", \"Fraction of SigLIP-DINO gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision-language pretraining effect\", 0.172, \"76%\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP-specific advantage\", 0.055, \"24%\"]\n          - [\"Total SigLIP - DINO gap\", 0.227, \"100%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 三个 vision encoder 的 RSA comparison，按 pretraining type 分色\n        （VL-contrastive = blue, self-supervised = orange）。Stacked annotation\n        分解 SigLIP-DINO gap 为 \"pretraining effect\" (76%) 和 \"encoder-specific\" (24%)。\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP baseline 在 worst 档下是 blocking experiment。如果 CLIP RSA 确实接近 SigLIP，\n      reviewer 攻击 \"这只是 VL pretraining 的 artifact\" 就有实质依据。应对：\n      (1) 正面接受并 reframe——\"vision-language pretraining, not task-specific fine-tuning,\n      is the primary source of action-relevant structure\"，这是更 general 的 insight；\n      (2) 讨论 SigLIP 剩余 24% 优势可能来自 training data scale (WebLI >> LAION) 或\n      architecture differences；(3) 核心 message 不变——LLM fine-tuning 仍然是 redundant，\n      但 \"vision encoder\" 应改为 \"vision-language pretrained encoder\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18234,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18234},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d02675b-d30b-4efe-8443-1dd9ac96b618","uuid":"2879adc5-a32b-41bc-8481-2f2b5bb40cfb"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":129574,"duration_api_ms":130785,"num_turns":1,"result":"我来分析每个 planned 实验在 worst 档位下的预测数据。\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  \"LLM degrades\" framing 不成立。Per-layer RSA 呈 U-shape 而非单调下降，LLM 深层恢复到接近 projector level，\n  说明 LLM 既不增强也不最终损害 action structure。Reframe 为 \"Representational Redundancy\"：\n  LLM 的 32 层变换是 lossy-then-recovery 过程，对 action structure 而言是 redundant bottleneck。\n  Random instruction control 出现 Δ>0.03，instruction invariance claim 需 weaken。\n  CKA 与 RSA ordering 不一致，需正面讨论 metric dependency。\n  补做 CLIP-ViT baseline 成为 blocking requirement 以分离 pretraining confound。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output (layer 0) 到 LLM 各层 (layer 1-32) 的变化轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      per_layer_rsa_layer0: 0.59\n      per_layer_rsa_layer4: 0.52\n      per_layer_rsa_layer8: 0.44\n      per_layer_rsa_layer12: 0.39\n      per_layer_rsa_layer16: 0.38\n      per_layer_rsa_layer20: 0.41\n      per_layer_rsa_layer24: 0.45\n      per_layer_rsa_layer28: 0.48\n      per_layer_rsa_layer32: 0.55\n      monotonicity_spearman: -0.18\n      trough_layer: 16\n      trough_rsa: 0.38\n      recovery_ratio: 0.85  # (L32 - trough) / (L0 - trough)\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档核心信号：RSA 不是单调下降而是 U-shape。Layer 0 (projector output) RSA ≈ 0.59\n      （略低于 d027 的 0.6153 因为 per-layer 提取方式略有不同），中间层（L12-L16）降至 trough ≈ 0.38\n      （接近 DINO 水平），但深层（L28-L32）恢复到 0.55 附近。Spearman 单调性 ≈ -0.18，远弱于\n      monotonic degradation 预期的 < -0.7。这个 U-shape 直接否定 \"LLM degrades\" 的线性叙事：\n      LLM 前半段确实破坏 action structure（为 next-token prediction 重组表征），但后半段\n      通过 residual connections 和 layer normalization 逐步恢复几何结构。最终 L32 的 0.55\n      虽低于 projector 的 0.59，但差距远小于 peak degradation 暗示的程度。这说明 LLM 是\n      lossy-then-recovery 过程，不是单向 degradation。核心 story 必须从 \"degrades\" 转为\n      \"redundant bottleneck\"——LLM 花了 32 层做了一个近似恢复原始结构的变换。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-layer RSA curve (trained, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"RSA ρ\", \"Δ from L0\", \"Phase\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (proj)\", 0.59, \"—\", \"projector output\"]\n          - [\"1\", 0.57, -0.02, \"early\"]\n          - [\"2\", 0.55, -0.04, \"early\"]\n          - [\"4\", 0.52, -0.07, \"early\"]\n          - [\"8\", 0.44, -0.15, \"mid-descent\"]\n          - [\"12\", 0.39, -0.20, \"trough approach\"]\n          - [\"16\", 0.38, -0.21, \"trough\"]\n          - [\"20\", 0.41, -0.18, \"early recovery\"]\n          - [\"24\", 0.45, -0.14, \"recovery\"]\n          - [\"28\", 0.48, -0.11, \"recovery\"]\n          - [\"30\", 0.52, -0.07, \"late recovery\"]\n          - [\"32\", 0.55, -0.04, \"output\"]\n      - name: \"U-shape statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman (layer index vs RSA)\", -0.18]\n          - [\"Trough layer\", 16]\n          - [\"Trough RSA\", 0.38]\n          - [\"L0 RSA\", 0.59]\n          - [\"L32 RSA\", 0.55]\n          - [\"Recovery ratio\", \"85%\"]\n          - [\"Monotonic degradation?\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Line plot: x-axis = layer index (0-32), y-axis = RSA ρ with action structure.\n        曲线呈明显 U-shape：从 L0≈0.59 下降到 L16≈0.38，再回升到 L32≈0.55。\n        水平虚线标注 DINO baseline (0.388) 和 SigLIP+projector (0.615)。\n        Shaded band 为 per-task bootstrap 95% CI。U-shape 在 trained 和 untrained\n        两条曲线上均可见，但 untrained 的 trough 更深（~0.35）且 recovery 更不稳定。\n    analysis: >\n      U-shape 是 worst 档的定义性信号。它否定了 \"monotonic degradation\" narrative，\n      但并不否定 vision encoder dominance（L0 仍是全局 peak）。Reframe 路径：\n      LLM 的 32 层变换是 representational detour——先破坏后恢复，净效果接近 identity。\n      这比 \"degrades\" 更 nuanced，但 \"redundant bottleneck\" 对 CoRL 仍有强 practical\n      message：如果 32 层 LLM 只是把表征转一圈回来，那架构可以大幅简化。\n      需要额外验证：(1) U-shape 在 untrained 条件下是否也成立；(2) recovery 是否\n      来自 residual connections（ablation: 去掉 residual 是否消除 recovery）。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"用随机/无意义 instruction 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 是否影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      random_inst_peak_rsa_trained: 0.445\n      random_inst_peak_rsa_untrained: 0.440\n      random_inst_peak_layer_trained: 12\n      real_inst_peak_rsa_trained: 0.4876\n      delta_random_vs_real_trained: 0.0426\n      delta_random_vs_real_untrained: 0.0446\n      delta_random_vs_no_inst_trained: -0.044\n      no_inst_peak_rsa: 0.4802\n      random_inst_direction: \"random < no_inst ≈ real_inst\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档预测 random instruction 的 RSA 显著低于 real instruction（Δ ≈ 0.04，超过\n      0.03 threshold），且方向出人意料：random instruction 不仅不等于 real instruction，\n      反而比 no instruction 还差。这说明 instruction invariance claim 过于简化——instruction\n      content 确实对 RSA 有影响，但方向是 \"garbage in → degradation\" 而非 \"meaningful\n      instruction → enhancement\"。真实 instruction 和空 instruction 效果相近（Δ=0.004），\n      但 random tokens 积极干扰 LLM 的表征处理，导致 action structure 额外损失。\n      这个结果动摇 Claim 3 的 \"instruction invariance\" 表述：instruction 的 presence\n      不 matter，但 instruction 的 content quality 在极端情况下 does matter。\n      机制解释：random tokens 激活 LLM 的 language processing pathways 产生 out-of-distribution\n      activations，这些 activations 与 vision tokens 在 attention 中竞争，导致 action-relevant\n      信号被稀释。No instruction 下 LLM 只处理 vision tokens，没有这种干扰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Instruction condition comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs Real Inst\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Real instruction (trained)\", 0.4876, 9, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Real instruction (untrained)\", 0.4846, 12, \"—\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (trained)\", 0.489, 30, \"+0.0014\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (untrained)\", 0.4802, 12, \"-0.0044\"]\n          - [\"Random instruction (trained)\", 0.445, 12, \"-0.0426\"]\n          - [\"Random instruction (untrained)\", 0.440, 10, \"-0.0446\"]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, \"—\", \"-0.0996\"]\n      - name: \"Instruction effect decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ RSA\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Real vs No instruction\", 0.004, \"No (< 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"Real vs Random instruction\", 0.043, \"Yes (> 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"No vs Random instruction\", 0.040, \"Yes (> 0.03)\"]\n          - [\"Random vs DINO\", 0.057, \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 6 条件的 peak RSA 对比（SigLIP+proj, real_inst, no_inst, random_inst,\n        DINO）。Error bars 为 bootstrap 95% CI。关键视觉信号：random_inst bar 明显低于\n        real_inst 和 no_inst，三者的 CI 不重叠。Annotation 标注 Δ=0.043 between\n        real and random instruction。\n      - >\n        Per-layer RSA curves for 3 instruction conditions (real, no, random) overlaid.\n        Random instruction curve 整体低于另外两条，且 peak 位置偏早（layer 12 vs 30），\n        暗示 random tokens 在深层持续干扰 recovery process。\n    analysis: >\n      Random instruction Δ > 0.03 使 \"instruction invariance\" 的绝对表述不成立。\n      需要 reframe Claim 3：从 \"instruction has no effect\" 改为 \"meaningful instruction\n      content is not utilized for action structure, but adversarial/random instruction\n      can actively degrade it\"。这实际上强化了 redundancy narrative：LLM 不利用\n      instruction 的语义信息来构建 action structure，但如果被喂入 noise，它的 language\n      processing machinery 会主动干扰 vision-derived signals。Practical implication：\n      VLA 部署时应确保 instruction 质量，或者直接去掉 LLM 以消除这个风险面。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保结论不是 RSA 指标特异性产物\"\n    expected_results:\n      cka_siglip_proj_vs_action: 0.52\n      cka_vla_trained_vs_action: 0.50\n      cka_vla_untrained_vs_action: 0.49\n      cka_dino_vs_action: 0.35\n      cka_ordering: \"SigLIP+proj ≈ VLA_trained ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO\"\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP+proj >> VLA_trained ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO\"\n      ordering_consistent: false\n      cka_siglip_vs_vla_delta: 0.02\n      rsa_siglip_vs_vla_delta: 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档预测 CKA 和 RSA 给出不同的 ordering。CKA 下 SigLIP+proj (0.52) 与 VLA (0.50)\n      的差距大幅缩小到 Δ=0.02（RSA 下是 0.127），使得 \"LLM degrades\" 或 \"LLM is redundant\"\n      的 claim 在 CKA 下几乎不成立——两者统计不可区分。原因：CKA 衡量的是 kernel alignment\n      （关注整体 representational similarity structure），对高阶几何变换更 robust；RSA 衡量的\n      是 pairwise distance 的 rank correlation，对 local distortions 更敏感。LLM 的变换\n      主要是 local geometric distortion（为 next-token prediction 旋转/缩放 representation），\n      这在 RSA 下表现为 degradation 但在 CKA 下被 absorbed。这意味着 \"LLM degrades action\n      alignment\" 是 metric-dependent conclusion，reviewer 可以攻击指标选择。同时 CKA\n      仍保持 DINO 显著低于其他条件（0.35 vs 0.49-0.52），所以 vision encoder dominance\n      claim 在两个指标下一致，只是 degradation claim 不 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"RSA vs CKA ordering comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"RSA ρ\", \"RSA Rank\", \"CKA\", \"CKA Rank\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+projector\", 0.615, 1, 0.52, 1]\n          - [\"VLA trained+inst\", 0.488, 2, 0.50, 2]\n          - [\"VLA untrained+inst\", 0.485, 3, 0.49, 3]\n          - [\"VLA trained no-inst\", 0.489, 2, 0.50, 2]\n          - [\"VLA untrained no-inst\", 0.480, 4, 0.48, 4]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 5, 0.35, 5]\n      - name: \"Metric agreement analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Claim\", \"RSA supports?\", \"CKA supports?\", \"Agreement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision encoder dominance (SigLIP >> DINO)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.227)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.17)\", \"Consistent\"]\n          - [\"LLM degradation (SigLIP >> VLA)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.127)\", \"Marginal (Δ=0.02)\", \"Inconsistent\"]\n          - [\"Training invariance (trained ≈ untrained)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.01)\", \"Consistent\"]\n          - [\"Instruction invariance (inst ≈ no-inst)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.004)\", \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\", \"Consistent\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Dual-panel figure: Left panel = RSA-based ordering (bar chart), Right panel = CKA-based\n        ordering (bar chart). Same conditions, same colors. 视觉对比清晰显示 RSA 下 SigLIP+proj\n        显著高于 VLA，但 CKA 下两者接近。红色 annotation 标注 inconsistency region。\n      - >\n        Scatter plot: x-axis = RSA ρ, y-axis = CKA, each point = one condition.\n        Points cluster along a roughly linear trend but SigLIP+proj is an outlier——\n        RSA 偏高但 CKA 不相应偏高，暗示 RSA 对该条件的 sensitivity 更高。\n    analysis: >\n      CKA-RSA ordering inconsistency 是 worst 档的第二个关键信号。它不摧毁整个 story\n      （DINO < VLA < SigLIP 的大序仍成立），但削弱了 degradation 的量化 claim。\n      应对策略：(1) 正面讨论 metric dependency，将其作为 contribution 之一（\"which\n      representational similarity metric is appropriate for evaluating action alignment\n      is itself an open question\"）；(2) 论证 RSA 的 rank-correlation nature 更适合\n      评估 action structure alignment（因为 action space 的 metric structure 是 ordinal），\n      但承认 CKA 给出 weaker version of the claim；(3) 将 degradation claim 从\n      \"LLM degrades\" 改为 \"LLM at best preserves, does not enhance\" action structure——\n      这在两个指标下都成立。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证核心发现\"\n    expected_results:\n      spatial_siglip_proj_rsa: 0.58\n      spatial_vla_trained_rsa: 0.47\n      spatial_vla_untrained_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_dino_rsa: 0.36\n      spatial_per_layer_monotonicity: -0.15\n      spatial_u_shape: true\n      cross_benchmark_ordering_consistent: true\n      spatial_instruction_delta: 0.005\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 的 task structure 与 LIBERO-Goal/Long 不同（强调空间关系而非\n      temporal sequence），预期整体 RSA 略低（空间关系在 action space 中更分散）。\n      但核心 ordering（SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_untrained >> DINO）应保持一致，验证\n      findings 不是单个 benchmark 的 artifact。U-shape 同样出现但 recovery 程度可能\n      更弱（空间任务的 action structure 更复杂，LLM recovery 更困难）。\n      Instruction invariance 同样成立（Δ ≈ 0.005），因为 LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction\n      同样是简单描述性语句，不提供超出视觉信息的 action guidance。\n      此实验在 worst 档下优先级低于 CLIP baseline，但如果有时间做可以增加 robustness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"LIBERO-Goal RSA\", \"LIBERO-Long RSA\", \"LIBERO-Spatial RSA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+projector\", 0.615, \"—\", 0.58]\n          - [\"VLA trained\", 0.488, 0.488, 0.47]\n          - [\"VLA untrained\", 0.485, 0.485, 0.46]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.388, 0.36]\n      - name: \"Ordering consistency\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"Ordering\", \"U-shape?\", \"Instruction Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.004]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Long\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.004]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"SigLIP >> VLA ≈ VLA_u >> DINO\", \"Yes\", 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        3-panel figure, one per benchmark.每 panel 是 per-layer RSA curve for trained/untrained\n        conditions。视觉一致性：所有 3 个 benchmark 都显示相同的 U-shape pattern 和\n        SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO ordering。Spatial benchmark 的绝对值略低但 pattern 一致。\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 预期复现核心 ordering，增强 generalization claim。但在 worst 档下，\n      此实验优先级低于 plan_003 (per-layer curve) 和 CLIP baseline（未在 plan 中但\n      worst 档下成为 blocking）。如果时间有限应优先完成 CLIP baseline。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT baseline (blocking under worst tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"N/A — not in original plan, becomes blocking under worst\"\n    description: >\n      补做 CLIP-ViT-L/14（与 SigLIP 同为 vision-language contrastive pretrained）baseline，\n      分离 SigLIP RSA 优势中 vision-language pretraining 的贡献 vs pure vision quality\n    expected_results:\n      clip_rsa: 0.56\n      clip_vs_siglip_delta: 0.055\n      clip_vs_dino_delta: 0.172\n      clip_vs_vla_delta: 0.072\n      pretraining_confound_fraction: 0.76  # (CLIP - DINO) / (SigLIP - DINO)\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下第四个 reviewer 攻击成为 blocking：SigLIP 的 RSA=0.615 优势是否完全来自\n      vision-language pretraining？CLIP-ViT 是同族模型（contrastive image-text pretraining），\n      预期 RSA ≈ 0.56，显著高于 DINO (0.388) 但略低于 SigLIP (0.615)。\n      这意味着 SigLIP-DINO gap 的 ~76% 可归因于 vision-language pretraining 本身，\n      而非 SigLIP 特有的架构/数据优势。这个结果迫使 story 调整：不能说 \"SigLIP vision\n      encoder 提供 action structure\"，而应说 \"vision-language pretrained encoders 天然\n      携带 action-relevant structure，且这种 pretraining bonus 比 VLA fine-tuning 更重要\"。\n      这实际上是一个 stronger insight（pretraining paradigm > fine-tuning），但需要\n      重写 Introduction 的 framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Vision encoder comparison with pretraining control\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"Pretraining\", \"RSA ρ\", \"Δ vs DINO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP-SO400M\", \"image-text contrastive (WebLI)\", 0.615, \"+0.227\"]\n          - [\"CLIP-ViT-L/14\", \"image-text contrastive (LAION)\", 0.56, \"+0.172\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2-L\", \"self-supervised (LVD-142M)\", 0.388, \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Confound decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"Component\", \"RSA contribution\", \"Fraction of SigLIP-DINO gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision-language pretraining effect\", 0.172, \"76%\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP-specific advantage\", 0.055, \"24%\"]\n          - [\"Total SigLIP - DINO gap\", 0.227, \"100%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 三个 vision encoder 的 RSA comparison，按 pretraining type 分色\n        （VL-contrastive = blue, self-supervised = orange）。Stacked annotation\n        分解 SigLIP-DINO gap 为 \"pretraining effect\" (76%) 和 \"encoder-specific\" (24%)。\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP baseline 在 worst 档下是 blocking experiment。如果 CLIP RSA 确实接近 SigLIP，\n      reviewer 攻击 \"这只是 VL pretraining 的 artifact\" 就有实质依据。应对：\n      (1) 正面接受并 reframe——\"vision-language pretraining, not task-specific fine-tuning,\n      is the primary source of action-relevant structure\"，这是更 general 的 insight；\n      (2) 讨论 SigLIP 剩余 24% 优势可能来自 training data scale (WebLI >> LAION) 或\n      architecture differences；(3) 核心 message 不变——LLM fine-tuning 仍然是 redundant，\n      但 \"vision encoder\" 应改为 \"vision-language pretrained encoder\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7d02675b-d30b-4efe-8443-1dd9ac96b618","total_cost_usd":0.30081399999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18234,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":6705,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6705,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18234},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":13191,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.013295999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":6705,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":18234,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.287518,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a1aa8784-b969-47a0-9617-a275270d79e6"}
